WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:02.790
That was delicious!

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.330
Glad you liked it!

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.080
Kururi, want to get in the bath?

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.120
Yeah-yuh!

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:10.700
Mutsumi-chan, you hop in too.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:11.620
Okay.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.370
We all have to do our best
to deal with our disadvantages.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:18.950
We must eat and rest properly, okay?

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.370
Disadvantage?

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.660
Were there people stronger than you all in Asgard?

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:25.910
Yes.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:34.200
Our abilities are the materialization of
the bio-energy "aether," that all life possesses.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.450
You could even call it a "soul."

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:44.160
In Asgard, there are higher-level gods
that possess far more aether than we Valkyries.

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:49.620
To tell the truth, that aether is also the reason that
these akuma are coming to attack Midgard.

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:54.750
The malevolent gods and the main gods in Asgard
have not gotten along for a long time now...

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:59.040
If this keeps up, it seems a huge war
will start amongst the gods.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.950
From here, we will infiltrate the enemy fortress
and kill him in a single strike!

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.950
We will exterminate them
without giving them a chance to suffer.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.660
Such is the destiny of the mighty.

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:11.660
As expected of Our Lady.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.160
You may be able to redeem
your sullied reputation with this.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:22.700
I truly have no words to express
my appreciation for this opportunity, Our Lady.

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:25.620
Now, let us go forth! It's time!

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:28.790
You mongrel.

00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:35.160
Be ashamed of the fact that had you
just made sure to kill Einheijer

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:38.160
we wouldn't have to trouble Our Lady with this!

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:44.290
That's some nerve you got,
mouthing off to me at your low social status!

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:47.080
What are you two whispering about?

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.330
Shine
Grin
Smile
Not a thing, Our Lady.

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:53.620
I'm certain I tore though Einheijer's stomach.

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:58.410
But you're not considering that a human
would have misteltein, are you?!

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.370
Misteltein? What is that?

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.160
Are you serious right now?

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:05.500
I'm not interested in anything besides Our Lady.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:10.040
Misteltein is one of only three pieces
of the Yggdrasil Ea in existence.

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:32.580
Mokkerkalfe
Blot
Misteltein

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:15.000
Misteltein, Blot, Mokkerkalfe...

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.830
each of those is an extremely dense
crystallization of aether!

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:21.910
Though we far surpass them in war potential,

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:23.910
what makes us incapable of a full-scale invasion

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:27.160
is the main gods having all three of them
in their possession.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:33.000
It merely boosts that human's pitiful abilities
to one where he revives the dead.

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:36.040
But this may also be our good fortune!

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:39.700
The precious item that should be sealed in
the treasure room of Valhalla in times of peace

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.410
is in a place that is easily within Our reach.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.450
Such ambition! You are so admirable, Our Lady!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:47.450
I am, aren't I!

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:55.830
But Our Lady, be that as it may, why did Odin
entrust such a treasure to Einheijer, a mere human?

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.080
Indeed.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:01.450
I love and respect my father,
but that alone I fail to understand.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.540
In contrast, this is just as expected of Misa.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.250
It's astounding how she's
ensnared the enemy at such a distance.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.830
You're malevolent gods, right?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:17.370
If you immediately turn tail and run back to Asgard,
I'll let you escape with your lives.

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:22.500
Among the gods are the full-blooded
and the demigods and goddesses.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.330
Basically, there are two types of demigods.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:29.120
In the current state, the biggest difference
is that the full-blooded gods

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.950
can't use their intrinsic abilities in the human word.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:35.750
In the three months since the battle
in the human world started,

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.250
we've somehow managed to hold out,

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:43.160
but you could also say that it's because the enemy
has prioritized preserving their front in Asgard.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:47.910
In the real competition there will be
demigods among the enemies as well.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:53.870
You dare come here alone,
unattended by Einheijer?!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.870
Surely, We have been underestimated.

00:03:56.910 --> 00:03:58.750
Take a note, Roskva.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:03:59.620
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:05.620
"One who does not understand one's position
at any given time is a fool."

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:09.450
Make me regret how easy
this instant kill will be, Valkyrie.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.330
Go ahead and kill me, if you can.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:18.410
Mada dare mo mita koto nai

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.290
Yume no naka de

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:29.250
Sagashita amai negai, kyou mo

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:37.620
Kizuite to, watashi no naka kara

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:42.500
Dare ka ga kimi e to sakebu yo

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:49.330
Mitsumeau, modokashii kyori ni

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:52.580
Abaredashita samishisa

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.540
Kamishimeru hitori

00:04:55.540 --> 00:05:00.450
Suki toiu omoi o

00:05:01.620 --> 00:05:05.580
Iitai demo ienai

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:12.330
Itsumo soba ni kimi ga iru no ni

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:17.660
Mada dare mo mita koto nai

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.700
Yume no naka de

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:24.540
Tomoshita tsuyoi omoi

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:30.950
Mayowanai mayoitaku wa nai kara

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:35.910
Shinjite ima, ippo fumidasou

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:40.370
For the sake of myself

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.620
Ugh, my dad sucks!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:49.330
Seriously unreal that he'd send me
to go buy snacks for him at this time.

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:50.910
Snow?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:56.160
Should you return to Asgard immediately,
your life will be spared.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.540
That's quite generous, isn't it, Valkyrie?

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:03.500
My father ordered me to do my best to not kill.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:07.750
If any more of us are killed by our own,
it's possible that Asgard would go to ruin.

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:10.450
Don't you all want to avoid that as well?

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:14.750
Destroying Midgard to gain power,
and uprooting the flow of Yggdrasil...

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:19.660
do you know just what consequences
that would bring about?

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:22.450
If you would just shut up and listen...

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:28.160
This is not a massacre; we are the future!

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.660
This is the military might that will
lead to the future of Yggdrasil!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.160
There is nothing left to say to you.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.870
Garm, Roskva.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.080
Do a warm-up before we get started.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:40.950
Ma'am.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:42.830
Garm?

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.080
I see, he's one of them.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:52.870
There's no need for us to display
our power for a Valkyrie without Einheijer.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.200
Damned with the misfortune of being
born into this world as a daughter of Odin...

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.200
Die!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:09.700
You're... You're the bastard who's been
toying with my beloved sisters, huh?!

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:11.750
Roskva!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.660
Move and I'll kill you.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.450
Don't make me go against my father's wishes.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:25.330
Wha?!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:30.700
Good grief. How long do they plan
to keep prattling on?

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:33.290
I suppose that's how Our Lady is...

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.750
Now then, what shall I do?

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:41.330
I can't catch that Valkyrie by surprise,
since the instant I get closer I'll be killed.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.830
I have no choice then.

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:50.120
Are you going to return to Asgard
and live a long life, or die right now?

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.950
You have ten seconds to decide.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.870
10, 9, 8...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.580
Th-this is alarming!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.540
Could a Valkyrie be that strong
even in her physical body?!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.580
If I can catch her off guard for just a moment...

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:07.450
Our Lady.

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.950
Please get away from here on your own.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.620
I will subdue her, even if it's at the cost of my life.

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:16.870
Oh, you two will subdue me?

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.950
This won't even take me a second.

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:22.870
Do not worry, Roskva.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.160
You won't need to take this note.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:28.080
We will never forsake you!

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:33.160
Tis is a complete farce.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.540
I can sense it
I can sense it.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:39.000
There's a presence sneaking up on me
from my blind spot.

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:42.080
According to my senses, it's a small-bodied man.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.870
Is he the arrow user that Futaba warned me about?

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:48.580
Did they think they could deceive me
with something like this?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:50.830
I thought I told them...

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:53.080
Move and I'll kill you!

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.200
Um...

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.200
A... human?!

00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:00.040
An opening!

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.950
"Kiss with Snorri" confirmed.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.160
Norn

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:06.950
Invoking Norn...

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:06.950
Invoked

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:21.250
Absurd! How can you summon
multiple akuma to Midgard?!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.660
Someone once said:

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.910
"A goddess is the symbol of love."

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:33.000
Looks like the tables have turned!

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.250
The Third Norn
"Skuld"
Egg Lv. 52

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:37.290
This is the end for you, Valkyrie!

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.620
That will not be happening.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.120
Itsuyo!

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:47.620
You were late getting home
so I came out here to see...

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:51.870
If you mess with my family any more,

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.660
I'll bind you up, got it?

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.950
Bind me up?

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:03.410
Did she always have that many eggs?!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.080
What do I do?

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.700
Natsuki-san still can't transform, and Ichika-san
can only move for a second afterwards...

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:13.410
Care to show us, Valkyrie of the chains...

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:16.200
just how long you can hold out?!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.540
No...

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:25.040
We are also wounded.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.120
Let's have today be just our debut.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.500
Next time, we will be sure to kill you.

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:33.500
We are the third Norn, Skuld.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:38.580
Tremble with fear as you
wait for your death, Einheijer!

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.290
Yes... I understand.

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:45.700
Please be careful on your way home.

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:48.910
How was Big Sister Ichika?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.910
The enemies have some demigoddesses
on their side as well.

00:10:51.910 --> 00:10:53.250
Seriously?

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:57.790
From here on, we'll make a huge change
in our tactics and respond to the enemy's moves.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:00.250
Now's the time to make our final push.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:04.950
We elder sisters must do our best
to support the others.

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.330
Right!

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.750
And now for our next story.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.700
For the past few days, there have been occurrences
of abnormal weather all over the world.

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:17.700
Even above the skies of Japan we have
already confirmed a record-breaking cold snap,

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:19.660
and according to an announcement
from the government,

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.290
they are making efforts to gather experts
to come up with a countermeasure.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:27.080
This will be a winter unlike any we have seen before.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.330
I brought you breakfast.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:35.000
Thank you again today, Natsuki-san.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.750
How are you feeling?

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.160
Let me see.

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:46.160
Thanks to everyone doing well,
I've been feeling very good recently.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:50.250
Thanks to your barrier, we've always been protected.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.500
But please, try to take care of yourself, okay?

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:58.330
I appreciate your concern, Natsuki-san.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:03.040
By the way, this novelization of
the manga was very good.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.000
W-was it?!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.700
This is why I can't stand people like you!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.910
I-I'm sorry!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.040
Is Big Sister Ichika angry?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.750
Yes. Takuma is still as useless as always, so...

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:21.120
He'd be so cool if he could
just get himself together, though.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:26.160
You really do like the Master, don't you?

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.700
What?! N-no, I don't care about him!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:34.830
I'd also like to meet with the Master soon.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:39.250
Val Love, "Massage Chest for 30 Seconds,"

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:40.370
accomplished.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.500
We did a good job!

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:48.700
Now, let's see, has she leveled up any?

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:49.870
Has she?

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:53.290
Brunhilde
Spear
Points until next level
Defense:
Range:  Short
Attack:
Special:

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.040
She didn't gain any experience points at all.

00:12:53.290 --> 00:12:56.830
When Natsuki-chan was doing this
she leveled up easily.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:59.410
That's because Natsuki's easy.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:06.200
Most likely, this is because Big Sister Ichika
doesn't accept Takuma-chan as a lover.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:08.330
What's up, Big Sis Ichika?

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.160
Are you still throwing a fit over this?

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:12.660
You said yourself it's too late to change our lover.

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:14.540
I am NOT throwing a fit!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:18.660
Then will you say "Takuma is our lover" for me?

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:19.750
Say it!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:26.330
I don't understand why that weakling is our lover.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.080
That wasn't very accepting at all.

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:31.370
How can I accept a fool
who can't effectively use his abilities

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.120
even though we're closing in on the enemy?!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:37.040
Big Sister, I baked an apple pie!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.200
What's this?

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:42.080
Yummy! As expected from my little sister!

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:45.660
Well, we must make sure each of us
are prepared for battle, right?

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:46.870
Right!

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.620
Welcome home, Captain, Takuma.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:55.450
Val Love, "Go Shopping Together," accomplished.

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:58.660
Welcome back. What'd you two get?

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.620
Get down to business! Create a six pack
Get BUFF just by reading!

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:03.450
A stupendous book that says you can
get stronger just by reading it!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.700
30 minutes to a stronger bod!!
THE FLESH BIBLE

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:06.700
The dwarves here on Midgar are truly amazing!

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:09.450
Big Sis Ichika, you may have gotten scammed.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.200
Wh-what'd you say?!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.500
What did you buy, Takuma?

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:17.500
Probably a study book or something,
since it's you we're talking about.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.830
Er, uh, yeah. Th-th-that's right.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:24.080
Well, I'm going back to my room now, so excuse me.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:31.000
We will now commence our
Norn Response Meeting!

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:36.000
Norn... I once heard a rumor,
but are they honestly that strong?

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:40.040
Basically, in Midgard, based on the specs
of the summoning stone,

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:43.080
the limit is one akuma summon a day.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:47.540
However, as long the one capable of
creating the akuma has the AP,

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:50.290
they can summon as many as they want.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:55.450
Most importantly, two years ago the three
Norn sisters took control of Grasil Palace,

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.200
and they are a respectable main troop
of the malevolent gods.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.500
We can't take our time with them.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:06.370
The problem is, we don't know why
the Norn withdrew so quickly last night.

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:09.040
What do you think, Big Sister Ichika?

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.950
R-right. Let me see...

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:18.580
I'm a worthless older sister,
to be taken by such a scam...

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:21.580
I-I told you, anyone could fall for that!

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:22.750
Don't worry about it!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:33.120
Pitiful

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.540
Thanks, Misa.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.790
As expected of my little sister...

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:29.290
About how much was it, Sis?

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:33.120
One was 10,000 yen,
and I bought one per person plus the dog...

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.080
O-one hundred thousand yen?!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.950
What was going on with Takuma's attitude earlier?

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:41.290
That was way too suspicious!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:44.750
The Captain told us what she bought,
but he wouldn't...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.660
could he have bought something there
besides a study book?

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:55.250
C-could he really have bought a... dirty magazine?!

